tection. A continuation bet of 300 chips accomplishes multiple goals: it charges potential flush draws, gets value from weaker pairs or hands like A7, K7, and maintains pressure. Checking would be too passive and could allow dangerous overcards (Q, K, A) or a heart to come on the turn. Since I'm in the lead overall and this is late in the match, I want to extract value while protecting my equity.\n\nAnswer: 300"}
